## Overview

{{ project_name }} is a Domain Control Unit serving as a zone gateway and body domain controller.
Built on the yuleOSH platform with {{ mcu }} MCU, target ASIL {{ asil_label }}.

## Key Features
- **CAN Routing**: Message forwarding between 3 CAN buses (body, chassis, diagnostic)
- **SOME/IP Gateway**: CAN-to-Ethernet signal gateway with 50 service instances
- **Signal Gateway**: Signal extraction, repacking, range validation
- **Diagnostic Gateway**: UDS routing to target ECUs
- **Safety**: ASIL B routing table CRC protection, E2E profiles

